sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant ProfileManager
    participant useProfileManager
    participant SubscriptionManager
    participant EventPublisher
    participant NIP05Service
    participant EventCache
    participant NOSTRRelay

    User->>ProfileManager: View Profile
    ProfileManager->>useProfileManager: Load profile(pubkey)
    useProfileManager->>EventCache: Check cache

    alt Profile cached
        EventCache-->>useProfileManager: Return cached profile
    else Profile not cached
        useProfileManager->>SubscriptionManager: Subscribe to kind 0
        SubscriptionManager->>NOSTRRelay: Request profile event
        NOSTRRelay-->>SubscriptionManager: Profile event
        SubscriptionManager-->>useProfileManager: Profile data
        useProfileManager->>EventCache: Cache profile
    end

    useProfileManager->>NIP05Service: Verify NIP-05
    NIP05Service-->>useProfileManager: Verification status
    useProfileManager-->>ProfileManager: Display profile
    ProfileManager-->>User: Show profile UI

    User->>ProfileManager: Edit Profile
    ProfileManager->>ProfileManager: Switch to edit mode
    User->>ProfileManager: Update fields
    User->>ProfileManager: Save changes

    ProfileManager->>useProfileManager: Publish profile(metadata)
    useProfileManager->>EventPublisher: Create kind 0 event
    EventPublisher->>NOSTRRelay: Publish event
    NOSTRRelay-->>EventPublisher: Success
    EventPublisher-->>useProfileManager: Event published
    useProfileManager->>EventCache: Update cache
    useProfileManager-->>ProfileManager: Update UI
    ProfileManager-->>User: Show success message
